<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I heard the voice of Jesus say,</l><l>“Behold, I freely give</l><l>The living water: thirsty one,</l><l>Stoop down, and drink, and live.”</l><l>I came to Jesus, and I drank</l><l>Of that life-giving stream;</l><l>My thirst was quenched, my soul revived,</l><l>And now I live in Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I heard the voice of Jesus say,</l><l>“I am this dark world’s Light;</l><l>Look unto Me, thy morn shall rise,</l><l>And all thy day be bright.”</l><l>I looked to Jesus, and I found</l><l>In Him my Star, my Sun;</l><l>And in that Light of life I’ll walk</l><l>Till trav’lling days are done.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
